7,church music | Never Pure and Rarely Simple,https://neverpureandrarelysimple.wordpress.com/tag/church-music/,"Church Slavonic and Latvian are both Indo-European languages, so I was on the lookout for any words which are obviously related to other IE languages I know about.Even though Church Slavonic and Latvian are both Balto-Slavic, they are obviously very different.","Slavonic, Church",Indo-European
